{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-09-03 08:15:00', 'title': 'PHOTO RELEASE - HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES NAMES STEWART HOLMES AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GOVERNMENT AND CUSTOMER RELATIONS', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., SEPT. 03, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT STEWART HOLMES HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GOVERNMENT AND CUSTOMER RELATIONS, SUCCEEDING MITCH WALDMAN, WHO WILL RETIRE ON SEPT. 30.'}